ARC-19.worked_example_ar:
تطبيق نمط Offline-First داخل الـ Repository:
```kotlin
class FeedRepositoryImpl(val dao: FeedDao, val api: FeedApi) : FeedRepository {
    override fun getFeed(): Flow<List<FeedItem>> = dao.observeFeed().map { it.map { e -> e.toDomain() } }
    override suspend fun syncFeed() = withContext(Dispatchers.IO) {
        val remote = api.fetchFeed()
        dao.withTransaction { dao.clearAndInsert(remote.map { it.toEntity() }) }
    }
}
```

